1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,243
Resisting arrest?

2
00:00:02,308 --> 00:00:03,229
Kill her on the spot!

3
00:00:05,156 --> 00:00:05,758
Go with them.

4
00:00:06,356 --> 00:00:07,925
What did you say?

5
00:00:08,092 --> 00:00:09,139
Fight them here,

6
00:00:09,269 --> 00:00:10,766
and you really become a fugitive.

7
00:00:10,984 --> 00:00:11,880
I'll come for you.

8
00:00:14,584 --> 00:00:15,370
I'll walk on my own.

9
00:00:17,073 --> 00:00:21,073
Mandatory mission: rescue Qin Shuang within three days.

10
00:00:21,164 --> 00:00:24,914
Failure: Qin Shuang's affection resets to zero.

11
00:00:27,049 --> 00:00:28,117
Xu Yan.

12
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,562
Keep your word.

13
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:30,243
I will.

14
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:31,755
Officer, sir,

15
00:00:31,808 --> 00:00:32,984
make me a copy of the warrant.

16
00:00:33,727 --> 00:00:34,615
And one more ingot.

17
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:35,766
Before dawn,

18
00:00:36,098 --> 00:00:37,096
you never saw me.

19
00:00:37,619 --> 00:00:38,881
A copy of the arrest warrant,

20
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,374
bought with Tang family money.

21
00:00:40,685 --> 00:00:41,361
It's on your tab,

22
00:00:41,429 --> 00:00:43,107
pay me back slowly.

23
00:00:43,173 --> 00:00:43,684
Okay,

24
00:00:43,742 --> 00:00:44,556
I'll pay.

25
00:00:48,725 --> 00:00:49,926
A-Ling?

26
00:00:52,325 --> 00:00:52,864
Where is she?

27
00:00:53,525 --> 00:00:54,266
The prefecture jail.

28
00:00:54,374 --> 00:00:55,978
We have to get her out within three days.

29
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,263
From Liuxi to here,

30
00:00:57,668 --> 00:00:59,274
you rode all night?

31
00:00:59,672 --> 00:01:01,303
The escort agency knocked at midnight.

32
00:01:01,364 --> 00:01:03,088
I left Xiaohe with Elder Han.

33
00:01:03,274 --> 00:01:03,705
One more thing,

34
00:01:04,141 --> 00:01:05,786
Dad's people in the capital sent a letter.

35
00:01:06,438 --> 00:01:08,523
A month ago, Wei Shaoqing

36
00:01:08,595 --> 00:01:10,639
went back to the capital with a painter.

37
00:01:10,737 --> 00:01:11,397
A painter?

38
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,217
Who's he going to paint?

39
00:01:12,780 --> 00:01:14,002
Here's the copy of the arrest warrant.

40
00:01:16,836 --> 00:01:17,922
This seal,

41
00:01:18,306 --> 00:01:18,938
is fake.
